 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 4.36,
   "text": "A week after you finish a book, most of it is gone. Not because your memory is bad,"
  },
  {
   "s": 4.58,
   "e": 8.28,
   "text": "because of what you do the moment you close it, and the fix takes about three minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": 8.72,
   "e": 11.54,
   "text": "Think about it, 300 pages around six hours of reading."
  },
  {
   "s": 12.08,
   "e": 15.38,
   "text": "A week later, a friend asks what it was about, and you've got one sentence."
  },
  {
   "s": 15.8,
   "e": 19.8,
   "text": "This curve is over a hundred years old. Memory drops fast in the first day then"
  },
  {
   "s": 19.8,
   "e": 23.48,
   "text": "keeps sliding, and rereading or highlighting barely slows it down."
  },
  {
   "s": 23.98,
   "e": 24.68,
   "text": "So what does?"
  },
  {
   "s": 25.32,
   "e": 29.2,
   "text": "Pulling it back out. When you close the book, write three lines from memory, no peaking."
  },
  {
   "s": 29.2,
   "e": 33.92,
   "text": "What it said one example in one thing you'll do. Then the next day, cover them and say them again."
  },
  {
   "s": 34.24,
   "e": 36.74,
   "text": "A week later once more, under three minutes in total."
  },
  {
   "s": 37.32,
   "e": 42.1,
   "text": "Every time you pull it back out, it sticks longer. A week later you can still explain the book."
  },
  {
   "s": 42.58,
   "e": 45.24,
   "text": "Here's the rule three lines from memory when you close the book."
  },
  {
   "s": 45.76,
   "e": 49.54,
   "text": "Again tomorrow, again in a week. Send this to the friend who highlights everything."
  },
  {
   "s": 50.02,
   "e": 54.2,
   "text": "That's what Demure is for. You archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow"
  },
  {
   "s": 54.2,
   "e": 57.02,
   "text": "and break it down into small steps you can actually do."
  },
  {
   "s": 57.02,
   "e": 61.62,
   "text": "Follow for one fix a day, tomorrow the one rule for the day after you miss a day."
  },
  {
   "s": 62.02,
   "e": 64.54,
   "text": "If you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio."
  }
 ],
 "wps": 3.63
